1
00:00:00,546 --> 00:00:02,476
I'd hate to miss that. Ahem.

2
00:00:04,049 --> 00:00:06,039
(Leonard:)Hey, where have you been?

3
00:00:06,285 --> 00:00:07,805
(Sheldon:)Oh, Leonard.

4
00:00:07,987 --> 00:00:09,787
(Sheldon:)If I was prone to sarcasm...

5
00:00:09,955 --> 00:00:14,725
(Sheldon:)...I'd say I was pulling off a major heist
at the Museum of Laundry Baskets.

6
00:00:16,362 --> 00:00:20,762
(Leonard:)One, two, three, four, five,
six, seven, eight, nine, 10.

7
00:00:21,634 --> 00:00:24,664
(Leonard:)I meant, golly, Sheldon,
you've been gone a long time.

8
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:29,070
Oh, well, I was waylaid
by Penny, Bernadette and Amy.

9
00:00:29,241 --> 00:00:32,511
(Sheldon:)They made me reveal confidential
information about Howard's father.

10
00:00:32,678 --> 00:00:35,578
- What information?
- I can't tell you that.

11
00:00:35,748 --> 00:00:39,908
I'm bound by closet organizer-organizee
confidentiality.

12
00:00:40,619 --> 00:00:42,179
(Raj:)Come on, we won't tell anyone.

13
00:00:42,354 --> 00:00:45,154
(Sheldon:)Sorry, badgering me won't work.
What you should have said is:

14
00:00:45,324 --> 00:00:47,914
"It's pointless to keep this a secret.
Penny will tell."

15
00:00:48,093 --> 00:00:50,323
- Fine, then that.
- All right, I'll tell you.

16
00:00:52,164 --> 00:01:01,024
(Sheldon:)My goodness,
everyone's on their game today.

